{{Codex|A full-auto pistol known as the most compact and lightweight weapon of the Grineer arsenal. Though it has a small Magazine Capacity, the Viper has a very high Fire Rate and ultra-fast reload times thanks to a simplified magazine design.}}

The '''Viper''' is a machine pistol of Grineer design issued to their [[Shield Lancer]]s. It is the most portable weapon manufactured by the [[Grineer]] and boasts a high rate of fire and an extremely efficient magazine reload, but poor accuracy.

This weapon can be sold for {{cc|2,500}}; it is also a [[weapon crafting ingredient]] for {{Weapon|Twin Vipers}} (x2) and {{Weapon|Hystrix}}.
{{Checklist|nocategory=true|
* {{Weapon|Bolto}} + {{Weapon|Viper}} → {{Weapon|Hystrix}}
* {{Weapon|Viper}} + {{Weapon|Viper}} → {{Weapon|Twin Vipers}}
}}

==Characteristics==
*This weapon deals primarily {{D|Impact}} damage.
*Can use the Viper-exclusive {{M|Skull Shots}} and {{M|Stinging Truth}} mods.
*Innate {{Pol|Madurai}} polarity.

{{Advantages|
*Tied with {{Weapon|Viper Wraith}} for fastest fire rate of all single-handed pistols.
}}

{{Disadvantages|
*Mediocre accuracy.
*Inefficient ammo economy.
}}

{{WeaponComparison|Twin Vipers}}
{{WeaponComparison|Viper Wraith|header=n}}

==Acquisition==
The Viper's blueprint can be purchased from the [[Market]].

{{BuildAutomatic|type=Weapon}}

==Tips==
*Although it is not recommended for long range fighting, correctly aiming and tapping the trigger will expend 1-2 bullets at once, and you may get a decent critical or headshot rate by doing this.
**This may be done more comfortably by making a secondary keybind for firing on mouse wheel. It shall also allow to fire in a way [[Shield Lancer]]s do.
*Using the {{M|Pistol Ammo Mutation}} mod can help regain lost ammo when needed. Alternatively, use {{M|Pistol Scavenger}} aura or bring along [[Squad Ammo Restore]].

==Trivia==
*The '''Viper''' was released on the 18th of March, 2013 with {{ver|7}}.
*On the Viper's barrel, the word {{GrineerScript|Viper}}, which translates to "Viper" is inscribed in the [[Grineer Language]]. In earlier versions of the game this line of text was {{GrineerScript|Serberus}} which translates to "Serberus", probably indicating an earlier name for the gun. The Viper's UI icon still shows a Viper with "Serberus" inscribed on it.
*The Viper(s) uniquely has a distinct sound when its trigger is released. This could be a mechanism used to stop the bullet feed or to halt the cyclic action.
*Until {{ver|17}}, [[Shield Lancer]]s fired their Vipers in three-round bursts, a holdover from when Shield Lancers used to be equipped with the {{Weapon|Sicarus}}.

==Bugs==
*When equipped by {{WF|Banshee}}, the Viper will clip entirely inside her fingers when in idle animation.

