'''Velox''' is {{WF|Protea}}'s [[Signature Weapon|signature]] automatic sidearm with high [[fire rate]], innate '''20%''' [[Ammo#Ammo_Efficiency|Ammo Efficiency]], and faster reload from an empty magazine. In the hands of Protea, Velox's Ammo Efficiency is increased to '''40%'''.

This weapon can be sold for {{cc|5,000}}.

==Characteristics==
*This weapon deals primarily {{D|Slash}} damage.
*Reloads '''50%''' faster from a fully depleted magazine.
*Can use the Velox-exclusive {{M|Velox Conclusion}} mod.
*Innate two {{Pol|Madurai}} polarities.

{{Advantages|
*Innate '''20%''' [[Ammo Efficiency]].
**When wielded by {{WF|Protea}}/{{WF|Protea Prime}}, ammo efficiency is increased to '''40%'''.
}}

{{Disadvantages|}}

{{WeaponComparison|Velox Prime}}

{{Acquisition|The Velox's component parts can be acquired from within the [[Granum Void]]; the Barrel from Rotation C, the Receiver from Rotation C of Extended Granum Void. The main blueprint can be purchased from the [[Market]]. All components, except for the blueprint, can be [[Trading|traded]] between players.}}
{{BuildAutomatic|type=Weapon}}

==Notes==
*Ammo efficiency is based on number of shots fired, and the free shot interval is carried over between magazine reloads.

==Bugs==
*Although its noise level is listed as "alarming", the weapon is actually silent and behaves like other silent weapons. However, it will still break {{A|Prowl}} insibility unless the {{M|Suppress}} mod is equipped.
*Having a [[Glaive (Weapon Type)]] equipped <u>visually</u> breaks the origin of bullets, they will be fired from a top left/right diagonal position of where the actual gun and barrel are. Still present in {{Ver|42.0.11}}. <div class="mw-collapsible mw-collapsed" data-expandtext="View Image">[[File:VeloxFireRateBug.png|400px]]</div>

